# Frontend TypeScript build gate

**Styling / dark-light contrast:** `.cursor/rules/frontend-styling.mdc` — CSS tokens, night/day checklist, component CSS patterns.

Vitest (`npm test`) does **not** run `tsc`. The Docker frontend image runs `npm run build` (`tsc && vite build`). A change can pass unit tests and still fail `make dev-build`.

## Before handback on frontend edits

Run from `frontend/`:

```bash
npm run build
```

Or at minimum `npx tsc --noEmit` when the change is types-only.

## API client calls

Match the **exported function signature**, not a nearby pattern from another feature. Example: `fetchConversations(sessionType?)` filters by `session_type` (`standard` | `job` | `run`); it is not a tenant-id loader. Tenant scoping is enforced server-side on the BFF session.

## BFF (`api/main.py`)

New route handlers need matching **imports** (`response_model` types, `UploadFile`, `File`, etc.). `TestClient(app)` only fails at import time when the module loads — add a proxy test under `api/tests/` (see `test_attachments_proxy.py`) so missing imports break CI before `dev-build`.

When copying load logic from another component, open `frontend/src/api/client.ts` and confirm parameter names and types before wiring.

## Static routes before `{param}` routes

Register fixed path segments **before** parameterized routes on the same prefix. Example: declare `GET /<resources>/stats` (or similar fixed segments) before `GET /<resources>/{building_id}` or FastAPI matches the fixed name as an id. Applies to `api/` routes.

## Multipart file uploads (FastAPI)

Any route using `UploadFile` / `File(...)` requires **`python-multipart`** in root `pyproject.toml` / API image deps. Without it the app fails at **import** with `Form data requires "python-multipart" to be installed`.
